# Documentation only: this application does not automatically load .env files.
# Set DJANGO_SETTINGS_MODULE in the shell for checks/tests if needed:
# DJANGO_SETTINGS_MODULE=mouod.test_settings
# manage.py also accepts --settings=mouod.test_settings.
#
# Future production work must introduce and verify environment-based secret,
# DEBUG, allowed-host, database, mail and cookie configuration explicitly.
# No such runtime environment variables have been added by this refactoring.
